							<xs:documentation>Indicates the unique ID of the Action to be canceled.  An ActionCancelCommand cannot complete while planning is in progress.  When planning completes, the System/Service responsible for performing the Action shall respond to the ActionCancelCommand.  Status of the cancellation is given in ActionCancelCommandStatus.  An ActionCancelCommand request for an Action that was previously planned and is currently being replanned to a new System might result in multiple ActionStatus canceled responses, one from each of the Systems it was allocated to.</xs:documentation>
