	<xs:complexType name="AugmentationProcessingParametersType" uci:version="000.000.000.000">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>This is a polymorphic extension which allows for the extension of the base ProcessingParametersPET for augmentation of products. Specific algorithms will have an extended type for additional parameters. Available extension types include: ImageAugmentationParametersType, VideoAugmentationParametersType, WeatherAugmentationParametersType.</xs:documentation>
