			<xs:element name="WaveformSpecificSettings" type="uci:CommWaveformCapabilityCommandPET" minOccurs="0">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Allows the Communication Planner to deviate from the MDF in a waveform specific manner applying configurations which are not common.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="LinkConnectionRequest" type="uci:LinkConnectionRequestType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates a command to change the connection status of the individual data links managed by the waveform. Generally, a link's connection status must be CONNECTED for the waveform to transmit payload data over the communication medium or for the waveform to receive transmissions from the communication medium.  Note that this parameter is not available until after a CommActivity is created and may not be available until the waveform has joined the network.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
