			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="PrimaryController" type="uci:PrimaryControllerType" minOccurs="0">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates the primary controller, generally an operator/HCI, of the Capability.  The primary controller is responsible for managing and responding to ControlRequests for the Capability.  The primary controller has exclusive responsibility for issuing ControlSourcesCommands (which reflect ControlRequests) and ControlInterfacesCommands to the Capability.  If this field is omitted then either the Capability is not operational or currently has no assigned primary controller.  See ControlTypeEnum annotations for further details.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="SecondaryController" type="uci:SecondaryControllerType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates a secondary controller, generally an operator/HCIs, of the Capability.  If this field is omitted then either the Capability is not operational or currently has no secondary controllers.  See ControlTypeEnum annotations for further details.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
