			<xs:element name="DataPlanID" type="uci:DataPlanID_Type">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates a unique ID assigned to the DataPlan.  Minor updates to the Plan can be indicated by an update of the value in the child Version element.  More significant updates, replacements, etc. might warrant a new Plan with a different child UUID value.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="ApprovalState" type="uci:DataPlanApprovalStatusEnum">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Describes the state of the Data plan within a well-defined state machine.  The states support allocation of Data planning functions across components within the communications architecture.  The DataPlan state machine is described in detail in UCI supporting documentation.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="Details" type="uci:DataPlanDetailsType">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Contains the Detail Data Plan that will be applied to Data-Link Gateways during the mission in order to perform ingress and egress of Mission System and Product data.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
		</xs:sequence>
	</xs:complexType>
