			<xs:documentation>This type identifies an Entity that was not observed in the time frame and/or location expected.  In Space operations, a Resident Space Object (RSO) entity is considered "lost" if it does not have any associated metric observations within the last 30 days.</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
