				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>A list of specific identity value or values to clear on an Entity. The associated identity field will be reset to the initial state and refilled by current sensor data. List size for this element is based on "Select All That Apply" condition.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
