				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="WeaponSystem" type="uci:EOB_WeaponSystemType" minOccurs="0">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Weapon System as determined by EOB and/or EOB correlation. This is value from the Combined Emitter Database as the Associated Weapon. See the Combined Emitter Database (CED) for more information.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="CED_Name" type="uci:EOB_CED_NameType" minOccurs="0">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>The associated CED name for this emitter. See the Combined Emitter Database (CED) for more information.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="EmitterSK" type="uci:EOB_EmitterSurrogateKeyType" minOccurs="0">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>The surrogate key in the source MIDB which uniquely identifies the emitter in the MIDB. Based on the Global Command and Control System Integrated Imagery and Intelligence (GCCS-I3) Application Program Interface Reference Manual (APIRM) for MIDB Data Access Layer (MDAL).</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="CodeWord" type="uci:EOB_CodeWordType" minOccurs="0">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>The description of this element may be found in the classified appendix of the MIDB. Based on the Global Command and Control System Integrated Imagery and Intelligence (GCCS-I3) Application Program Interface Reference Manual (APIRM) for MIDB Data Access Layer (MDAL).</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
		</xs:sequence>
