		<xs:sequence>
			<xs:element name="RouteExecutionPlanSet" type="uci:RouteExecutionPlanSetType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates a route based execution plan set.  It is defined by a single RoutePlan together with optional and unbounded RouteActivityPlans, ActivityPlans, and CommScheduleAllocations. It's allowed for RouteExecutionPlanSets that share the same RoutePlan if the combination of other *Plans in the set are different. For example, depending on a specific condition, the same RoutePlan may be flown but with a different RouteActivityPlan.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="OrbitExecutionPlanSet" type="uci:OrbitExecutionPlanSetType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates a orbit based execution plan set.  It is defined by a single OrbitPlan together with optional and unbounded RouteActivityPlans, ActivityPlans, and CommScheduleAllocations. It's allowed for OrbitExecutionPlanSets that share the same OrbitPlan if the combination of other *Plans in the set are different. For example, depending on a specific condition, the same OrbitPlan may be flown but with a different OrbitActivityPlan.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
