							<xs:documentation>Indicates the type of source that originally created the associated File, regardless of how/by-whom/when it was introduced to a UCI network.  For example, for files created by a Subsystem, the creation source is SUBSYSTEM.  For files generated by a non-UCI mission planning system, ground station or other external entity and then introduced to a UCI network by a UCI bridge/adapter Service, a creation source of IMPORTED should be used.</xs:documentation>
						</xs:annotation>
					</xs:element>
					<xs:element name="UntrustedModification" type="xs:boolean">
						<xs:annotation>
							<xs:documentation>Indicates whether this File has been altered from its original form by a user, external (i.e. non-system) component or other untrusted service.</xs:documentation>
