						</xs:annotation>
					</xs:element>
					<xs:element name="C2Indicator" type="xs:boolean">
						<xs:annotation>
							<xs:documentation>Indicates if this platform is a C2 Node. Utilized to ensure the correct message interaction according to MIL-STD-6016 which causes different workflows based upon whether a Node is a C2 Node.</xs:documentation>
