				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates the activation state of a SubPlan or SubPlans of the associated MissionPlan. An instance of this element should include all of the SubPlans in a given state; the cardinality is based in the number of states in the associated activation state enumerated type.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
