			<xs:element name="AssociatedTime" type="uci:TimeFunctionType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="12">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates time related events that are associated to the Op data type such as when activated or when operational. The multiplicity is limited to N-1 options where NONE is an event that has no value, thus removed from list of available options.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="SystemScheduleOverride" type="uci:SystemScheduleStateType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>System-specific schedule that will override any part of the main schedule. This allows for system-specific schedule different than main schedule. When adding a SystemScheduleOverride, the child SystemID also must be added to the sibling SystemID list if the sibling list is not empty. The SystemScheduleOverride is independent of time planning. For the system, this override can be done at execution.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
