				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="AutonomousOpManipulationPolicy" type="uci:MA_AutonomousDataManipulationPolicyEnum">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Sets what Mission Autonomy can do when in the package leader role with respect to Op* type management for its team members. In all cases, platforms shall not modify Op* instances and Commands coming from above(Mission Planning, C2, or package leader MA).</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="RankConflictPolicy" type="uci:MA_RankConflictPolicyEnum">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>In the case that conflicting incompatible OpCommands can't be deconflicted due to equal rank, this policy will dictate what approach Mission Autonomy shall use to deconflict those Commands.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="PriorityConflictPolicy" type="uci:MA_PriorityConflictPolicyEnum">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>In the case that conflicting incompatible Op* types occupy the same space and time and can't be deconflicted due to equal priority, this policy will dictate what approach Mission Autonomy shall use to deconflict those Op* types.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
		</xs:sequence>
