					<xs:documentation>Indicates current route planning settings for the autonomous generation of contingency paths along the primary path. If multiple instances are given, each must be of a different path type as indicated by the child element.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
		</xs:sequence>
	</xs:complexType>
