						<xs:annotation>
							<xs:documentation>Indicates a proposed Response for the planning process.  A Response given here is added to any Responses provided in the sibling ProposedResponsePlan to create the full set of Responses to be considered by the planning process.  A Response given here overrides the same Response in the sibling ProposedResponsePlan.  An empty list here, combined with no sibling ProposedResponsePlan is considered a command to deallocate previously allocated Tasks.</xs:documentation>
