			<xs:element name="DataPayloadOriginatorID" type="uci:SystemID_Type" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates a data originator for data on this topic. To subscribe to messages on the specified topic from only a subset of originators, specify those originators using this field. If no DataPayloadOriginatorID values are specified then all data originators will be allowed.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="SubscriptionID" type="uci:MA_SubscriptionID_Type">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates the unique ID that represents the subscription to a topic from a set of data originators.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="SubscriptionFilterType" type="uci:MA_SubscriptionFilterType" minOccurs="0">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Specifies a filter for the data received via this topic. The SubscriptionFilterType can be used in addition to the Topic to provide further filtering of messaging within a specific Topic, or across all Topics. This allows a system to exclude messages in the Topic that do not meet its needs during a period of operation. Could be implemented as a receive filter or transmit filter.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="Priority" type="uci:ComparableRankingType" minOccurs="0">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates the priority of the subscription relative to others. Priority gives guidance on which subscriptions to favor when resources are limited.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
		</xs:sequence>
