				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="Parts" type="uci:OrbitPlanPartsEnum" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="6">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates a part (kind of action) in the OrbitPlan referenced by the sibling OrbitPlanID element to be used as a constraint when creating the commanded *Plan.  If any are given, only those parts are constraints.  If omitted, all parts should be used. List size for this element is based on "Select All That Apply" condition.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
