			<xs:element name="OrbitPlanID" type="uci:OrbitPlanID_Type">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates a unique ID assigned to the OrbitPlan.  Minor updates to the Plan can be indicated by an update of the value in the child Version element.  More significant updates, replacements, etc. might warrant a new Plan with a different child UUID value.</xs:documentation>
