				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>This element references a product by the parent task or command that created it (or is yet to create it).  In some cases, a task or command can result in generation of more than one product type.  As a result, it is sometimes necessary to include the product type when referencing a product in this way.</xs:documentation>
