					<xs:documentation>Use this type when the cataloged orbit is different than the orbit you have.  Use this for lost items, items that have maneuvered, and items that have changed orbital states between the last cataloging and the current orbital state. If the expected or last reported orbit is valid, omit this value.</xs:documentation>
