					<xs:documentation>Indicates the unique ID of a Path within the RoutePlan that is being referenced.  This element is used if only specific Paths are being referenced, excluding others.  If specified, all Segments of the Path are being referenced, in addition to any given by the sibling SegmentID.  If this element and the sibling SegmentID are not specified, then all Paths and Segments of the RoutePlan are included in the reference.</xs:documentation>
