			<xs:element name="ServiceState" type="uci:ServiceStateEnum">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates the current state of the Service. The state machine and allowable transitions for Service states is described in supporting documentation. A given Service might not support all states. Service state may be controlled via ServiceLifecycleCommand. See enumeration annotations for further details.</xs:documentation>
