					<xs:documentation>Free text field to provide detail about the status of the service.  An example use of this field would be to give information about why a service is Degraded.  The intent of this element is to provide situational awareness to the operator and is not intended to trigger any specific functionality.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
