				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="Configuration" type="uci:VehicleConfigurationType" minOccurs="0">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>The predicted or required vehicle conditions upon reaching the OpPoint.  Applicable for INGRESS and EGRESS OpPoints and/or OpPoints associated with specific SystemIDs.
For endurance in an INGRESS OpPoint this element will indicate endurance remaining upon reaching the point.  For an EGRESS OpPoint this endurance will indicate the predicted/planned endurance required to egress from the point to the System's base.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
		</xs:sequence>
