					<xs:documentation>The state of the applicable operational type (OpPoint/OpLine/OpVolume/Opzone):
Active or Inactive.

If ScheduleState is provided, the State is applied to the System based on the identified Schedule.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="ScheduleState" type="uci:ScheduleStateType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
