			<xs:enumeration value="EHS_ENHANCED_SUPPORT">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Continually elicits long replies for dynamic transponder information in BDS Registers 40, 50 and 60 in addition to periodic Elementary Surveillance information</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:enumeration>
			<xs:enumeration value="ELS_ELEMENTARY_SUPPORT">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Periodically elicits long replies for quasi-static transponder information in BDS Registers 10, 17 and 20, but is otherwise limited to short replies as in Surveillance Only. Note that long replies provide Mode 3/A and Mode C information in addition to BDS Registers.</xs:documentation>
