					<xs:documentation>Indicates support for multiple separate but parallel *Plans, additive in nature, that together last for the duration of the associated Mission.</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:enumeration>
		</xs:restriction>
	</xs:simpleType>
